  <p id="c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:baojing" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:baojing:m0000" ref="o8f_bqq_bot">鮑靚</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:baojing:m0004" ref="o8f_bqq_bot">太玄</persName>，東海人也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:office" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:office:m0000" ref="o8f_bqq_bot">靚</persName>學兼內外，明天文河洛書，稍遷南陽中部都尉，為南海太守。</p>
